{"4409430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Velocide Overdrive", "steam_appid": 4409430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4429200], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NEW IN 1.3.0: BOSS MODE (PVE &amp; CO-OP)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The biggest update to Velocide Overdrive is finally here. Team up with 1 to 4 players and discover a whole new dimension of gameplay by taking on epic Bosses with unique mechanics:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in a strategic naval battle against the fearsome <strong>Galleon</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to survive <strong>Synthetic</strong>, a pure &quot;bullet hell&quot; survival trial driven by an intense soundtrack.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each encounter demands a different tactical approach. Cooperate with precision to claim victory, or go down together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4409430/extras/d72b4be6612546261192998f3b6ff407.poster.avif?t=1780303192\" width=1080 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4409430/extras/d72b4be6612546261192998f3b6ff407.webm?t=1780303192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4409430/extras/d72b4be6612546261192998f3b6ff407.mp4?t=1780303192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY WITH OR AGAINST YOUR FRIENDS (TOTALLY FREE)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a barrier-free multiplayer experience. Thanks to the Steam Remote Play Together feature, <strong>you only need one copy of the game to gather your squad</strong>. You can play with up to 4 players online, without them needing to own the game themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic local multiplayer is also available for intense shared-screen sessions. Share the experience with ease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4409430/extras/37dbac7093bcf2c44c5dcdab44f09613.avif?t=1780303192\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4409430/extras_big/37dbac7093bcf2c44c5dcdab44f09613.avif?t=1780303192 width=1560 height=872 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE THE ARENA AND DOMINATE THE CHAOS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Velocide Overdrive</strong> is an arena game with a brilliantly ruthless concept: you control a perpetually moving line. Your goal is to dodge the walls, avoid your own trail, and not crash into your opponents' trails. The last survivor of the round scores the most points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the true intensity of the game lies in its arsenal. With <strong>over 90 power-ups</strong> spawning randomly, no two matches are ever the same and victory is never guaranteed:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use ruthless classics like <strong>Homing Missiles</strong> or the <strong>Divine Laser</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate the environment with <strong>ChronoBreak</strong>, defying both time and your reflexes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trigger the terrifying <strong>Revolution</strong> bonus, capable of bringing a round to a sudden and brutal end.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4409430/extras/198fabc20ed4fed1c30a1203ca6cc65f.avif?t=1780303192\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4409430/extras_big/198fabc20ed4fed1c30a1203ca6cc65f.avif?t=1780303192 width=1560 height=874 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASSIVE CONTENT, UNLOCKED IMMEDIATELY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To guarantee instant fun, all base cosmetic content is unlocked right from your very first match. No more grinding for hours just to enjoy customization options. The game offers a wealth of content designed to make every session unique:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>90+</strong> Devastating power-ups to turn the tide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>18+</strong> Arenas with unique environments and rules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20+</strong> Original player skins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>24+</strong> Unique colors to stand out on the track.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>13+</strong> Kill styles to obliterate your opponents with flair.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, round modifiers (Double Points, Negative Points, Team Mode) will regularly shake things up when you least expect it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4409430/extras/5e60fa8783519a0e5dc8cded5bb957b0.avif?t=1780303192\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4409430/extras_big/5e60fa8783519a0e5dc8cded5bb957b0.avif?t=1780303192 width=1560 height=872 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4409430/extras/e2d02821482bea140dad0a89e7f1fad5.avif?t=1780303192\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4409430/extras_big/e2d02821482bea140dad0a89e7f1fad5.avif?t=1780303192 width=1560 height=868 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Velocide Overdrive</strong> is a solo-developed indie project continuously shaped by community feedback. Climb the global leaderboards, hunt down Steam Achievements, and get ready to turn your quiet game nights into an absolute battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>So, ready to enter the arena?</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NEW IN 1.3.0: BOSS MODE (PVE &amp; CO-OP)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The biggest update to Velocide Overdrive is finally here. Team up with 1 to 4 players and discover a whole new dimension of gameplay by taking on epic Bosses with unique mechanics:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in a strategic naval battle against the fearsome <strong>Galleon</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to survive <strong>Synthetic</strong>, a pure &quot;bullet hell&quot; survival trial driven by an intense soundtrack.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each encounter demands a different tactical approach. Cooperate with precision to claim victory, or go down together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4409430/extras/d72b4be6612546261192998f3b6ff407.poster.avif?t=1780303192\" width=1080 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4409430/extras/d72b4be6612546261192998f3b6ff407.webm?t=1780303192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4409430/extras/d72b4be