_item_assets/steam/apps/4409430/extras_big/5e60fa8783519a0e5dc8cded5bb957b0.avif?t=1780303192 width=1560 height=872 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4409430/extras/e2d02821482bea140dad0a89e7f1fad5.avif?t=1780303192\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4409430/extras_big/e2d02821482bea140dad0a89e7f1fad5.avif?t=1780303192 width=1560 height=868 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Velocide Overdrive</strong> is a solo-developed indie project continuously shaped by community feedback. Climb the global leaderboards, hunt down Steam Achievements, and get ready to turn your quiet game nights into an absolute battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>So, ready to enter the arena?</strong></p>", "short_description": "Velocide Overdrive is a brutal, fast-paced game with 90+ power-ups. Invite your friends to play for free: one copy is all it takes to ruin friendships and dominate the chaos. Only one rule matters: don't finish last!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean, Spanish - Latin America, Hungarian, Japanese, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Czech, Thai, Turkish, Ukrainian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4409430/267dbf8971e3be1beab155675cafd8adad97abd9/header.jpg?t=1780303192", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4409430/05ba1e50b92c061fb73e757528ff304b4b55baf5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780303192", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4409430/05ba1e50b92c061fb73e757528ff304b4b55baf5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780303192", "website": "https